Parakeet Redux is Moondream's ternary quantization of NVIDIA's
parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 speech recognition model.

The model is downloaded separately after user confirmation; it is not included
in the Nexus distribution. Nexus performs local inference through the separately
installed Moondream / Kestrel runtime, under that runtime's own license terms.
